1
00:00:00,122 --> 00:00:01,702
What am I supposed to do?

2
00:00:01,874 --> 00:00:04,544
(Leonard:)Pretend I believe something I don't
when I'm with Penny?

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:10,090
(Howard:)Hey, I'm sure Penny fakes
all kinds of things when she's with you.

4
00:00:10,924 --> 00:00:14,014
Do me a favor.
Lean over, put your head right here.

5
00:00:15,095 --> 00:00:17,225
(Howard:)Let me show you another way
to look at this.

6
00:00:17,389 --> 00:00:21,099
(Howard:)Here we have the universe
of all women.

7
00:00:21,268 --> 00:00:23,478
Okay, these are the ones
you wanna sleep with.

8
00:00:23,645 --> 00:00:26,735
(Howard:)These are the women
who believe exactly what you believe.

9
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:30,439
(Howard:)These are the women
who would be willing to sleep with you.

10
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,320
(Howard:)And right there,
in the little triple intersection...

11
00:00:34,531 --> 00:00:35,781
...is your ideal mate.

12
00:00:35,949 --> 00:00:38,619
Odds are she's a short physicist
with low self-esteem...

13
00:00:38,786 --> 00:00:41,956
...who lives in a government
research facility in China.

14
00:00:42,956 --> 00:00:44,286
(Leonard:)What's your point?

15
00:00:44,458 --> 00:00:46,838
(Leonard:)To keep having a sexual relationship
with Penny...

16
00:00:47,044 --> 00:00:50,464
...I have to give up everything I believe in?
My intellectual integrity?

17
00:00:50,631 --> 00:00:54,301
(Leonard:)The very nature of who I am?
I can't do that, Howard.

18
00:00:54,468 --> 00:00:59,018
(Howard:)I respect that.

